Re-adds the backend experiments to the published crates, for a scratch tree
only (benchmarks/experiments/prepare.sh applies it; never commit the result).

- spawned-rt: the `backend-experiments` feature, the sharded pool and native
  dispatchers (rt/src/tasks/experimental*), the dispatch gate and the
  SPAWNED_EXPERIMENT_RUNTIME selection in threads::block_on.
- spawned-concurrency: the `backend-experiments` feature, scheduler routing at
  actor spawn (SPAWNED_EXPERIMENT_SCHEDULER), MessageTurn batching/time slicing
  in the dispatch loop and its unit tests.

These hooks sit on the actor hot path, so they cannot live in the published
crates even behind a feature. Removed from the tree after 0.8.0; the last
commit that still had them in place is d082d0d8.

